\>", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001817254428553*^9, 4.0018172565384235`*^9}}],

Cell["\<\
Mathematica 9 launcher. Evaluate the notebook from top to bottom. SelfTest[] \
verifies the field convention and linear algebra; RunStudy[] regenerates the \
descriptive CSV files, exports Figures 1--5, and displays those figures below \
its progress messages.\
\>", "Text"],

